                            <title_copy
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-11-24T05:38:16.951-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="Develop as a leader"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"
                                variant="h"/>
                            <text
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-19T02:22:57.308-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Our leaders play an essential role in bringing out the best in our teams. As a new or aspiring leader at AbbVie, you have access to training resources and specialised programmes focused entirely on developing your leadership skills, including our: &lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Skills-Focused Workshops,&lt;/b> solutions and resources for leaders to develop critical skills that expand capabilities and build business knowledge&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Leading at AbbVie&lt;/b>,&amp;nbsp;a cohort-based program that supports first time people leaders with critical skills needed to successfully lead individuals and teams &lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Key Talent Leadership Programs&lt;/b>,&amp;nbsp;a suite of customised learning solutions designed for key talent leaders selected by their business for accelerated development &lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;b>Impact Through Inclusion Learning Series&lt;/b>, which are awareness courses that help build cross-cultural effectiveness&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <separator
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2025-11-24T05:42:09.224-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-11-24T05:42:09.224-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <title
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2025-11-24T05:43:10.323-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-11-24T05:43:38.507-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="Learning anytime, anywhere"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"
                                variant="h"/>
                            <text_617239820
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2025-11-24T05:44:04.634-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-11-24T05:45:17.328-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="nandivx5"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>No matter your role, level, or background—we make sure you have the space to grow. Here’s what you’ll have access to any time of year:&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>On-demand webinars delivered by global content experts and AbbVie leaders&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Talent Link, an internal platform to build your network and grow your brand&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </container_1199983605>
